Subject: [PATCH] CAM AI: the progress card keeps the finished pass on screen
 when a try is dropped, stays under 100 % until the program is there, and says
 when it tries another way (finding H1-34)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVyxNm2Fwb8M6A8TiczcwA
---
